% gen358 (LLMSCORE foundation): bounded semantic projection. The universal
% evidence scorer selects one topic from teachable semantic_topic_cue/2 facts;
% the fixed answer-frame engine then reads a declared source once. Unknown
% topics therefore decline in bounded time instead of querying a recursive
% projection once per input token.
answer_projection(semantic_summary, semantic_topic_cue).
% gen396: la stessa proposizione, nella lingua di chi ha chiesto, e PRIMA della
% sorgente inglese. `concept_gloss/3` non e' una ternaria qualunque: il suo
% secondo argomento non e' un metadato da enumerare, e' una faccetta che la
% sessione ha gia' fissato. `projection_source_facet/3` nomina la relazione
% unaria che la lega — quindi il motore non conosce nessuna lingua, e domani una
% faccetta diversa (registro, dominio) costa una riga e zero C. Senza gloss
% localizzata la sorgente declina e si passa a quella inglese: nessuna
% traduzione inventata.
projection_source(semantic_summary, concept_gloss, ternary).
projection_source_facet(semantic_summary, concept_gloss, current_language).
projection_source(semantic_summary, game_play_localized, ternary).
projection_source_facet(semantic_summary, game_play_localized, current_language).
projection_source(semantic_summary, wiki_concept, ternary).
% The direct game-play frame uses the same indexed projection, so localized
% rules remain reachable before the English fallback.
answer_projection(game_play, semantic_topic_cue).
projection_source(game_play, game_play_localized, ternary).
projection_source_facet(game_play, game_play_localized, current_language).
projection_source(game_play, game_play, binary).
projection_source(semantic_summary, explanation, binary).
projection_source(semantic_summary, because, binary).

