% Open-world Task IR binding.  These facts describe grammatical boundaries;
% they do not enumerate possible entities.  C reads their byte spans and
% canonicalizes whatever the user put between them.  Consequently a new noun
% phrase can enter task_ir/2 without task_entity_cue/2 or a rebuild.
task_boundary_cue(pair_separator, keyword(and)).
task_boundary_cue(pair_separator, keyword(or)).
task_boundary_cue(goal_marker, keyword(for)).
